ription\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity documents observations from monitoring.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Disseminate Information' event can occur only if it was immediately preceded by a 'Review Intelligence' event, and no other 'Review Intelligence' event is allowed between that 'Review Intelligence' and the 'Disseminate Information'. This ensures a one-to-one and ordered pairing between 'Review Intelligence' and 'Disseminate Information', preventing any 'Disseminate Information' from occurring without the necessary prior 'Review Intelligence' and avoiding overlapping or multiple 'Review Intelligence' before an 'Disseminate Information'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Intelligence' activity reassesses the intelligence and reports for accuracy.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity shares the reviewed intelligence with stakeholders.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity shares the reviewed intelligence with stakeholders.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then 'Analyze Data' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents collecting data f